<p style="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Emerging
growth company <span id="xdx_907_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20250702__20250702_zTsgBoQPWd1l"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-07-02" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000034" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

